<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cardinal Health.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cardinal Health.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Cardinal Health Inc to intermediate, long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Cardinal Health gained 3/4 to 59-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Separately, on Thursday, Cardinal Health said revenues in the fourth quarter are expected to be at the lower end of expectations. The company, however, said it was comfortable with analysts' consensus earnings estimate of $0.55 a share for the fourth quarter.</p>
</text>
